## Two-level Sparse Storage Format (BSR + Bitmap) for Sparse MHA

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。

Two-level Sparse Storage Format是STOF提出的用于在GPU MHA kernel中统一表示任意sparse attention mask的两级存储格式，结合Block Compressed Sparse Row (BSR)和bitmap。该格式将mask矩阵按两级抽象组织：OuterTile (OT) 级——每个OT为64个8×8 InnerTile (IT)，OT作为coarse-grained skipped block单元；InnerTile (IT) 级——每个IT为8×8元素块，内部64个元素的mask pattern用一个uint64 bitmap_mask值精确表示。OT被分为"full"（内部所有IT均非空）和"part"（内部至少一个IT含mask元素但非全满）两类。存储结构由6个数组组成：(a) full_row_ptr/full_col_idx——用CSR格式表示full OTs的位置（row pointer + column index）；(b) part_row_ptr/part_col_idx——用CSR格式表示part OTs的位置；(c) load_row_ptr/load_col_idx——将full和part OTs合并按row-major order排列的unified loading index（load_row_ptr[i+1] - load_row_ptr[i] = row i中需要加载的total OT数）；(d) bitmap_mask——每个part OT对应64个uint64值（每个表示一个IT的8×8元素mask pattern），共64×64=4096 bits = 512 bytes per part OT。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。

Two-level storage format在block-wise MHA kernel中的使用流程（STOF Algorithm 1）：

```
// ===== Mask Preprocessing (offline) =====
// Input: mask matrix M ∈ {0,1}^{seq_len × seq_len}
// OT_Size_M = OT_Size_N = 64 (64个8×8 IT = 512×512 elements per OT)
//
// 1. Partition M into OT grid:
//    num_OT_rows = ceil(seq_len / OT_Size_M)
//    num_OT_cols = ceil(seq_len / OT_Size_N)
//
// 2. For each OT at (row, col):
//    if all 64 ITs in OT are non-empty → mark as "full"
//    elif at least one IT is non-empty → mark as "part"
//    else → skip (empty OT, no computation needed)
//
// 3. Build arrays:
//    full_row_ptr[i] = cumulative count of full OTs up to row i
//    full_col_idx[k] = column index of k-th full OT (global order)
//    part_row_ptr[i] = cumulative count of part OTs up to row i
//    part_col_idx[k] = column index of k-th part OT
//    bitmap_mask[part_ot_idx][it_idx] = uint64 mask for IT it_idx
//    load_row_ptr = merge full_row_ptr and part_row_ptr
//    load_col_idx = merge full_col_idx and part_col_idx

// ===== Kernel Runtime =====
for i in [0, ceil(seq_len / OT_Size_M)):        // Row-Parallel Dimension
    Q_i = Load_from_HBM(Q_HBM_i)                  // Q_i in registers (resident)
    load_num = load_row_ptr[i+1] - load_row_ptr[i] // # of valid OTs in row i
    part_num = part_row_ptr[i+1] - part_row_ptr[i]
    tmp_part_idx = 0

    for kv_idx in [0, load_num):
        j = load_col_idx[load_row_ptr[i] + kv_idx]  // OT column index
        K_Tj = Load_from_HBM(K_HBM_j)                // K tile to SMEM
        V_j = __async_memcpy(Load_from_HBM(V_HBM_j)) // async V load (overlap with GEMM)

        P_ij = Compute_GEMM(Q_i, K_Tj)  // Q_i(register) × K_Tj(SMEM) → P_ij(register)

        // Apply fine-grained mask if current OT is a "part" OT
        if tmp_part_idx < part_num and j == part_col_idx[part_row_ptr[i] + tmp_part_idx]:
            Apply_Mask(P_ij, bitmap_mask[tmp_part_idx])
            // bitmap_mask[tmp_part_idx] is uint64[64] array
            // For each IT (8×8), extract 64-bit mask and zero out masked positions in P_ij
            tmp_part_idx++

        S_ij, alpha = Softmax(P_ij)       // Online Softmax with scaling factor
        O_i = O_i × alpha + Compute_GEMM(S_ij, V_j)  // Accumulate with rescaling

    result_HBM = Write_back_to_HBM(O_i)
```

8×8 IT size的设计理由：正好匹配NVIDIA Tensor Core的mma.m16n8k16操作粒度，且64个elements恰好填满一个uint64（每个element占1 bit），bitwise操作（POPC/bitwise OR/shift）可直接用于mask判断而无需额外memory lookup。IT列主序存储消除bank conflict（同一warp内线程访问同一IT的不同列时映射到不同bank），OT行主序支持Softmax的iterative row-wise reduction。

