```
// ===== Kernel Selection Analytical Model (STOF Eq. 1) =====
// Input: load_row_ptr (valid OT counts per row), seq_len
// Output: threshold < 0 → row-wise kernel, threshold ≥ 0 → block-wise kernel

threshold = (load_row_ptr[ceil(seq_len/16)] / (ceil(seq_len/16))²) 
          - (τ / (log₂(ceil(seq_len/16)))²)
// τ = 1.2 (empirically set coefficient)
// 
// 解释: 第一项 = valid OT ratio per row → ratio越小(row越稀疏)threshold越小
//       第二项 = log penalty → 压制extreme sparse长序列场景
//         (seq_len增大但mask width不变时，虽然sparsity升高，
//          但OT总数增多，block-wise kernel更合适)
//
// 决策逻辑:
// - threshold < 0: valid OT极少+seq_len短 → row-wise kernel
//   (集中row-wise mask处理, warp内shuffle零sync overhead)
// - threshold ≥ 0: 通用场景 → block-wise kernel
//   (partition到SMEM利用memory hierarchy, Q register resident)

// ===== Block-wise Kernel Key Optimizations =====
// 1. Q Register Resident:
//    Q_i 切分后保持在register中跨KV tile循环复用
//    避免重复从SMEM加载Q_i（FA2需每次从SMEM读Q）

// 2. Async Data Copying:
//    cp.async (__async_memcpy) 异步加载V_j → GEMM(P_ij, V_j) 
//    无需等待V_j传输完成，V_j加载与Q_i×K_Tj GEMM重叠

// 3. OT-level Computation Skipping:
//    仅加载load_row_ptr/load_col_idx指定的valid OTs
//    无效OT（全empty）完全跳过——无memory access也无compute
//    Bigbird mask (sparsity 80.8%): 仅~19.2% OTs需要计算

// 4. IT-level Fine-grained Mask:
//    对part OTs用bitmap_mask做per-element mask
//    每个8×8 IT = 64 elements → 1个uint64表示 → POPC/shift并行mask

// 5. SMEM Double Buffering:
//    K_Tj/V_j共享同一块SMEM物理区域
//    OT_Size_M × OT_Size_N 根据cache capacity和SM数量确定

// 6. Tensor Core Alignment:
//    8×8 IT对齐mma.m16n8k16 operand tile → 直接喂给Tensor Cores
//    无需额外坐标变换

// ===== Performance Characteristics =====
// - 小seq_len (128-512): row-wise kernel常胜出（低sync cost）
// - 大seq_len (2048-4096): block-wise kernel显著优势
//   (batch=16, seq_len=4096, sliding window 93.8% sparsity):
//   STOF block-wise kernel vs FA2: 4.8× on A100
//   STOF block-wise kernel vs FlexAttention: 4.9× on A100
```

