// → row-wise kernel: warp内shuffle, 零warp间sync

// 场景2: BERT-Base, batch=16, seq_len=4096, Bigbird (80.8% sparsity)
// OT grid: 64×64, load_row_ptr[256]≈12/row
// → block-wise kernel: SMEM hierarchy利用, Q register resident
```

